@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il36-nouns`

-- Builders for the records of il36-nouns.l4, for callers (the tests, and an adapter such as the one
-- the capstone of row IL-07 would write).  They are not law: they set the facts the Ordinance decides to
-- the plain case, and each named variant changes the facts its name says and no others.
--
-- A record cannot be copied with one field changed, so the general builders take every field, and the
-- named variants are the plain case with one change each.  The general builders take their parameters
-- in the order the fields are declared; the named variants are what a reader should check by name.

§ `Builders`

§§ `An individual`

GIVEN `the visa`       IS A BOOLEAN
      `the basket`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the cancelled`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `the veteran`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the first time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the ceased`     IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the adaptation` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the days in 2028` IS A NUMBER
      `the days in 2029` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`a general individual` `the visa` `the basket` `the cancelled` `the veteran` `the certificate` `the day` `the first time` `the ceased` `the adaptation` `the days in 2028` `the days in 2029` MEANS
    `An individual` WITH
        `name` IS "tester"
        `holds an oleh visa or an oleh certificate under the Law of Return` IS `the visa`
        `is counted in a class of persons determined entitled to an absorption basket under section 2 of the Absorption Basket Law` IS `the basket`
        `had Israeli citizenship cancelled under section 11 of the Citizenship Law` IS `the cancelled`
        `is a veteran returning resident as section 14(a) of the Ordinance defines the term` IS `the veteran`
        `holds a returning resident certificate issued by the Ministry of Aliyah and Integration` IS `the certificate`
        `the day the person became an Israeli resident, determined without section 14(b)(1) of the Ordinance` IS `the day`
        `that day is the first time the person became an Israeli resident` IS `the first time`
        `the day the person ceased to be an Israeli resident` IS `the ceased`
        `the first day of the adaptation year the person elected under section 14(b)(1) of the Ordinance` IS `the adaptation`
        `days spent in Israel in tax year 2028` IS `the days in 2028`
        `days spent in Israel in tax year 2029` IS `the days in 2029`

-- The plain immigrant: an oleh visa, first became a resident on the day, still resident, no adaptation
-- year, 365 days in Israel in each of 2028 and 2029.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

-- The plain veteran returning resident: section 14(a)'s definition and the certificate.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`a veteran returning resident who became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE `the day` FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant counted in an absorption basket class, who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an oleh whose Israeli citizenship was cancelled under section 11 of the Citizenship Law, who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

-- A person who meets section 14(a)'s test of a veteran returning resident but holds no certificate.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`a returning resident with no certificate, who became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `the day` FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

-- A person who is neither an immigrant nor a veteran returning resident.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`a person who is neither an immigrant nor a veteran returning resident and became an Israeli resident on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

-- An immigrant (oleh visa) who became a resident on the day but not for the first time.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who became an Israeli resident, not for the first time, on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` FALSE NOTHING NOTHING 365 365

-- An immigrant who ceased to be an Israeli resident on a day (the first day of non-residence).
GIVEN `the day`   IS A DATE
      `the ceased` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` `and ceased to be one on` `the ceased` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE (JUST `the ceased`) NOTHING 365 365

-- Section 4's facts: the day of ceasing and the days in Israel in 2028 and in 2029.
GIVEN `the day`    IS A DATE
      `the ceased` IS A DATE
      `the days in 2028` IS A NUMBER
      `the days in 2029` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` `, ceased to be one on` `the ceased` `, and stayed in Israel` `the days in 2028` `days in 2028 and` `the days in 2029` `days in 2029` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE (JUST `the ceased`) NOTHING `the days in 2028` `the days in 2029`

-- Section 4's facts for a person who has not ceased to be a resident but stayed few days in Israel.
GIVEN `the day`    IS A DATE
      `the days in 2028` IS A NUMBER
      `the days in 2029` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` `, has not ceased to be one, and stayed in Israel` `the days in 2028` `days in 2028 and` `the days in 2029` `days in 2029` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING NOTHING `the days in 2028` `the days in 2029`

-- An immigrant who elected an adaptation year under ITO s 14(b)(1), beginning on a day.
GIVEN `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the adaptation` IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An individual`
`an immigrant who first became an Israeli resident on` `the day` `and elected an adaptation year from` `the adaptation` MEANS
    `a general individual` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `the day` TRUE NOTHING (JUST `the adaptation`) 365 365

§§ `An item of income`

GIVEN `the day`         IS A DATE
      `the amount`      IS A NUMBER
      `the source`      IS A `A source of income under section 2 of the Ordinance`
      `the chargeable`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `the exertion`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other`       IS A BOOLEAN
      `the transparent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the section 62A` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the in Israel`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `the relative`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requested`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `the source` `the chargeable` `the exertion` `the other` `the transparent` `the section 62A` `the in Israel` `the relative` `the company` `the requested` MEANS
    `An item of income` WITH
        `the day it was produced or accrued` IS `the day`
        `the amount` IS `the amount`
        `the source` IS `the source`
        `chargeable income apart from this Law's own exemption` IS `the chargeable`
        `income from personal exertion as the Ordinance defines it` IS `the exertion`
        `other income as section 62A(d) of the Ordinance defines it` IS `the other`
        `attributed to the individual from a transparent corporation` IS `the transparent`
        `attributed to the individual under section 62A of the Ordinance` IS `the section 62A`
        `produced or accrued in Israel` IS `the in Israel`
        `received from a relative as section 88 of the Ordinance defines the term` IS `the relative`
        `received from a company wholly owned by the immigrant` IS `the company`
        `the part of the amount for which the individual requested otherwise` IS `the requested`

-- The plain case: a salary (section 2(2)), chargeable, personal exertion, produced in Israel, not other
-- income, attributed from nobody, not from a relative, nothing asked to be left taxable.
GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a business income of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income received from a relative of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE 0

-- Received from a company wholly owned by the immigrant: a "relative" under the Ordinance, but not
-- under this Law.
GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income received from a company wholly owned by the immigrant, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 0

GIVEN `the amount`    IS A NUMBER
      `the day`       IS A DATE
      `the requested` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` `of which the individual requested` `the requested` `not to be exempt` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `the requested`

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an income from another source (such as rent or interest) of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `any other source of income` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a business income that is other income under section 62A(d), of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a business income attributed from a transparent corporation, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a business income attributed from a transparent corporation under section 62A, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income produced or accrued abroad, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`an employment income that is not chargeable income, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `work, section 2(2) of the Ordinance` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`a business income that is not income from personal exertion, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `a general item of income` `the day` `the amount` `a business or profession, section 2(1) of the Ordinance` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0

§§ `A non-resident entity and its items`

GIVEN `the non-resident`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requested`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `the transparent`   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An entity`
`a general entity` `the non-resident` `the requested` `the shareholder` `the transparent` MEANS
    `An entity` WITH
        `name` IS "entity"
        `is a non-resident entity` IS `the non-resident`
        `the entity requested otherwise` IS `the requested`
        `the individual is a material shareholder in the entity` IS `the shareholder`
        `is a transparent corporation as section 1 of the Law defines the term` IS `the transparent`

GIVETH AN `An entity`
`a plain non-resident entity` MEANS `a general entity` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVETH AN `An entity`
`an entity that is not a non-resident entity` MEANS `a general entity` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVETH AN `An entity`
`a non-resident entity that requested otherwise` MEANS `a general entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE

GIVETH AN `An entity`
`a non-resident entity in which the individual is a material shareholder` MEANS `a general entity` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE

GIVETH AN `An entity`
`a non-resident transparent corporation` MEANS `a general entity` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of an entity's business income`
`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `An item of an entity's business income` WITH
        `the day it was produced` IS `the day`
        `the amount` IS `the amount`
        `produced in Israel` IS TRUE
        `because of the personal exertion of the individual` IS TRUE
        `the part attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents` IS 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of an entity's business income`
`an entity's business income produced in Israel apart from the individual's exertion, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `An item of an entity's business income` WITH
        `the day it was produced` IS `the day`
        `the amount` IS `the amount`
        `produced in Israel` IS TRUE
        `because of the personal exertion of the individual` IS FALSE
        `the part attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents` IS 0

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of an entity's business income`
`an entity's business income produced abroad through the individual's exertion, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `An item of an entity's business income` WITH
        `the day it was produced` IS `the day`
        `the amount` IS `the amount`
        `produced in Israel` IS FALSE
        `because of the personal exertion of the individual` IS TRUE
        `the part attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents` IS 0

GIVEN `the attributed` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount`     IS A NUMBER
      `the day`        IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of an entity's business income`
`an entity's business income through the individual's exertion, of which` `the attributed` `is attributed to Israeli-resident rights-holders, of` `the amount` `produced on` `the day` MEANS
    `An item of an entity's business income` WITH
        `the day it was produced` IS `the day`
        `the amount` IS `the amount`
        `produced in Israel` IS TRUE
        `because of the personal exertion of the individual` IS TRUE
        `the part attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents` IS `the attributed`
